00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:34.760
which is like starting
with the team,

00:04:34.760 --> 00:04:37.820
it's like even before
that, which is--

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:44.060
but having the mindset of like,
this will turn into that. So

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:46.580
I think right now
it's like just

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:49.490
looking at the different
tools that are out there,

00:04:49.490 --> 00:04:51.410
understanding how

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:55.370
