Katherine, I see your
hand raised here.

00:44:36.930 --> 00:44:39.930
KATHERINE: Yeah, I was just
going to comment that even

00:44:39.930 --> 00:44:42.600
if you're not on

00:44:42.600 --> 00:44:46.830
a full data science team
in an organization that has GitLab

00:44:46.830 --> 00:44:49.290
and R professional tools--

00:44:49.290 --> 00:44:51.030
before I was at Centene,

00:44:51.030 --> 00:44:55.710
I was the only R user and a
data science team of one. And I

00:44:55.710 --> 00:44:59.250
basically made a setup script for
myself that had some of my

00:44:59.250 --> 00:45:03.990
most helpful functions in it. And
in my little profile, I said,

00:45:03.990 --> 00:45:06.190
put all these in my
session at startup.

00:45:06.190 --> 00:45:06.840
And so it was.

00:45:06.840 --> 00:45:09.900
It was a function for dealing
