01:03:25.560 --> 01:03:28.620
So we'll be off from
Hangouts for July.

01:03:28.620 --> 01:03:32.360
But we'll be back the
first week of August.

01:03:32.360 --> 01:03:35.540
So yeah, next week with Joe
Chang. Hope to see you there

01:03:35.540 --> 01:03:37.580
too. Bye, everybody.

